# Publish a docs site > The job's half
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/publish-site.md#L55
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# The same whole publish; these are its second half. Reading the site is NOT
# part of publishing it: a different person, at any later time, outside the
# publish event's own stretch of space and time. It follows it.
whole::a Publish a docs site ::e

push::a Push to the site repository ::e
  --> deploy::a Deploy job updates the website ::e
push, deploy --::P--> whole

whole --> read::a Read the website ::e

job::a Pages deploy job --> deploy
pages::a GitHub Pages --> deploy, read

repo::a infinite-pm-web --> push, deploy
html::a built HTML files --> push, deploy
site::a infinite.pm --> deploy, read
dev::a Docs maintainer --> push
visitor::a Site visitor --> read

job --> deploy job ::c
pages --> static hosting ::c
repo --> site source ::c
html --> static HTML ::c
site --> website ::c
dev --> Maintainer ::c
visitor --> Reader ::c
